e:m_ex_biscuit_03_12","text":"They're just different variations on a barking sound, I suppose.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_13","text":"Hee hee.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_14","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_14","text":"... Alrighty then.","jump":"m_ex_biscuit_03_16"},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_15","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_15","text":"I'm gonna need a little more information.","jump":"m_ex_biscuit_03_16"},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_16","text":"Oh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_17","text":"Allow me to explain.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_18","text":"Each bark is best suited to a type of puppy U ´ᴥ` U","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_19","text":"Arf arf! is for real powerhouse puppers U ´ᴥ` U","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_20","text":"Ruff ruff! is for super peppy puppies U>ᴥ<U","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_21","text":"Woof woof! is for timid yet delightful doggos U=ᴥ=U","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_22","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_22","text":"In that case, I prefer \"Arf arf!\"","jump":"m_ex_biscuit_03_25"},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_23","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_23","text":"In that case, I prefer \"Ruff ruff!\"","jump":"m_ex_biscuit_03_27"},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_24","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_24","text":"I'm still going with \"Woof woof!\" as my favorite.","jump":"m_ex_biscuit_03_29"},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_25","text":"That makes more sense that you'd choose that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_26","text":"So you like frolicsome fluffy bois.","jump":"m_ex_biscuit_03_33"},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_27","text":"Ah-hah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_28","text":"I knew you'd be a sucker for those cuddly little livewires!","jump":"m_ex_biscuit_03_33"},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_29","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_30","text":"I'm surprised.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_31","text":"I thought for sure","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_32","text":"you'd pick one of the other two choices.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_33","text":"I'm also a fan of Grrr.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_34","text":"Grrr?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_03_35","text":"What kind of puppy makes that noise?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_03_36","type"